    "text": "At <math><msup><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> copper <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> has <math><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi></math> unit cell structure with cell edge length of <math><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#8491;</mi></math> . What is the approximate density of <math><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></math> (in <math><mi>g</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> ) at this temperature?<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>63.55</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
